<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Let U Go (with Elyscia)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Jace!, Elyscia</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Let U Go (with Elyscia)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2OcWQntKdczymYruJhgEg8</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.220" end="00:18.270">You take my words and twist them, bend them in two directions</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.270" end="00:24.230">Your mind's unstable, it's out of control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.230" end="00:30.170">My signals weakening, I'm losing all my connection</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.170" end="00:35.210">I need some help before I lose control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.210" end="00:40.970">Oh, I'm slowly fading</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.970" end="00:43.930">Oh, why?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.930" end="00:47.760">I still can't let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.760" end="00:53.360">My heartbeat's racing, I'm losin' myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.360" end="00:59.620">Then why's it so hard to let you go?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.620" end="01:05.600">You're so demanding, you take the air I breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.600" end="01:12.130">So why's it so hard to let you go?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.130" end="01:15.620" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Words and twist them)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.620" end="01:18.580">It's tears on all on her phone, 'cause he ain't pick it up (bitch, ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.580" end="01:21.530">She packin' a bag, she gone, 'cause he wouldn't listen up (bitch, ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.530" end="01:24.130">It's spirits all in her home, but it's just the last one (last ones)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.130" end="01:27.140">That he sayin' that she ain't feelin' alone, they thinkin' about gettin' 'em gone (bitch, ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.140" end="01:30.140">She could have a hunnid motherfuckin' niggas and still say all 'em wrong (bitch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.140" end="01:33.200">I could have a hunnid motherfuckin' women and still take all 'em home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.200" end="01:34.700">Oh, that's why you in my face?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.690" end="01:36.190">Oh, that's why you broke my phone? (bitch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.100" end="01:39.070">Oh, that's why every time you cry, you use your eyes for a shoulder to be on?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.070" end="01:43.060">Oh, that's why every time you lie, you switch it on me and start looking for reasons? (bitch, ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.060" end="01:44.730">Ayy, but she ain't finding shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.730" end="01:48.040">The reason that shit wasn't workin' out, is 'cause you had them other niggas (bitch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.040" end="01:51.040">Every time I felt like it was a drought, I had to get up and go get it (bitch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.040" end="01:53.620">Anytime you gettin' up out that house, is when you gon' party and kick it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.620" end="01:56.980">She keep sayin' that she don't even want no spouse unless he talkin' 'bout chicken</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.980" end="02:00.290">Only thing she love more than herself is alcohol and Benjamin's (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.290" end="02:01.790">She gon' keep on trippin' (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.710" end="02:03.210">I'ma keep on sittin' back (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.140" end="02:04.640">She gon' keep on sippin' liquor (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.610" end="02:06.110">I'ma keep on chillin' (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.070" end="02:07.660">You go on ahead, fuck with them niggas (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.660" end="02:09.160">Girl, I don't know them niggas (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.070" end="02:10.580">When shit get old, you feelin' alone (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.580" end="02:12.080">You better still hold them niggas (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.030" end="02:15.100">I don't know why I'm stuck in her head, she treatin' me like the voices (voices)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.100" end="02:18.130">I don't know why she won't leave my bed, she startin' to be annoyance (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.130" end="02:21.310">I don't know why she hooked on them drugs, she just tryna fill her avoidance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.310" end="02:24.220">She don't know why she keep hittin' the club, she just tryna find assurance (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.220" end="02:27.130">Fuck that shit, hop in Urus, we don't gotta drop no more tears</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.130" end="02:30.350">If you saying you want it, it's yours, if I say, "I want it," it's mine too (damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.350" end="02:31.850">She ain't even tryna hear it (hear it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.450" end="02:33.210">'Cause she ain't being lied to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.210" end="02:34.710">That's one of my biggest fears (bitch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.660" end="02:37.190">'Cause you a fuckin' lie too (damn, bitch)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.190" end="02:38.760">Ayy, you know? (ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.760" end="02:40.260">How I've been (ayy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.690" end="02:41.770">I've been T'd up (ayy, 'cause you a fuckin' lie too, damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.770" end="02:45.450">Boot up a pack, you know? I've just been getting to money</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.450" end="02:48.490">Money everywhere, money everywhere, money on the floor (ayy, 'cause you a fucking lie too, damn)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.490" end="02:54.350">How can I hear you when you choose to leave words unspoken?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.350" end="03:00.230">Two worlds collide when we don't use control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.230" end="03:06.230">Our temperatures keep risin', dangerously, we explode</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.230" end="03:14.080">It's clear to me that we have no control, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.080" end="03:19.970">We're slowly fading, oh, why?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.970" end="03:25.940">Too complicated, oh, why?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.940" end="03:31.870">To understand it, oh, why?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.870" end="03:35.760">Afraid to let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:35.760" end="03:41.650">My heartbeat's racing, I'm losin' myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.650" end="03:47.600">Then why's it so hard to let you go?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:47.600" end="03:53.560">You're so demanding, you take the air I breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:53.560" end="03:59.520">So why's it so hard to let you go?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:59.520" end="04:02.570" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(My heartbeat's racing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:02.570" end="04:05.440" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I'm losing myself)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:05.440" end="04:12.390" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Then why's it so hard to let you go?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:12.390" end="04:17.720">You go, you're so demanding</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:17.720" end="04:20.650">You take the air I breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:20.650" end="04:26.530">So why's it so hard to let you go?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:26.530" end="04:29.520">To let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:29.520" end="04:35.260">To let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:35.260" end="04:39.260" /></div></body></tt>